Z||000004||GodSend||07-29-2001||12:27 AM||||I think your looking to get your hands on IRM (hope thats right) integrated rocker panels.  You basically remove the lower sections right infront the rear wheels and install these babys.  They look really nice don't then?  But they come at a price, I think they run about 600$ bucks and are not easy to come by.<P>As far as I know, they do not have a website, but a member will be able to hook you up with the number.  I hear they also appear on EBAY from time to time.<P>Do a search for it, and also try a search for "scoops", you will find some cheaper alternatives (although not as drastic looking) too.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.hypernetcommunications.com/revn.gif"> ||||reg||1
